<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - FANCO TRADES EX-DIV THURS.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - FANCO TRADES EX-DIV THURS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said shares of textiles firm Fanco will trade ex-dividend on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Company   Dividend/share   Coupon    Ex-div opening price</p>
<p>    Fanco	 80 drachmas	2		1,145</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
